---
title: Alfredo Sauce
image: https://www.thereciperebel.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/easy-alfredo-sauce-TRR-23-of-37.jpg
servings: 5
cuisine: Italian
---

In a #pot{} melt @butter{1/4%cup}, @garlic{6%cloves}(minced), and @cream cheese{1%8oz brick} over low heat.

Add in @garlic powder{2%tsp} and mix.

Slowly incorporate @milk{1/2%cup} and continue to mix until all lumps are gone.

Add @parmesan cheese{3/4%cup}(shaved or grated, about a 6oz bag). Continue stirring over heat until melted and mixed entirely.